{
  "sections": {
    "breadcrumbs": {
      "type": "breadcrumbs",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "text_alignment": "start",
        "padding_top": 16,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "blocks": {
        "ss_badge": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<span class=\"ss-pdp-badge\">La filtration à la source</span>"
          }
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "ss_facts": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ss-pdp-facts\"><div><b>Préoccupations</b>Particules visibles au robinet, qualité de l&#x27;eau du lavabo</div><div><b>Technologie</b>Filtration mécanique multi-couches des sédiments</div><div><b>Durée d&#x27;un sédiment</b>2 à 3 mois selon ton eau</div></div>"
          }
        },
        "variant_picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "button",
            "swatch_type": "shopify_swatch",
            "swatch_style": "circle",
            "swatch_size": 32,
            "button_style": "normal",
            "size_title": "Size",
            "size_chart_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "buy_buttons": {
          "type": "buy_buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_quantity_selector": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout": false,
            "show_gift_card_recipient": false
          }
        },
        "reassurance": {
          "type": "icon-with-text",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "vertical",
            "title_font": "body",
            "title_size": "text-base",
            "icon_1": "check",
            "heading_1": "<strong>Sélection Sunsoari</strong> : marques choisies avec exigence",
            "icon_2": "truck",
            "heading_2": "<strong>Livraison suivie</strong> en France métropolitaine",
            "icon_3": "check",
            "heading_3": "<strong>Paiement sécurisé</strong> : CB, Apple Pay, PayPal"
          }
        },
        "acc_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Compatibilité",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Compatible avec la plupart des robinets standards grâce aux adaptateurs fournis. Conseil : essaie d'abord le plus petit adaptateur, puis monte en taille si nécessaire.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "acc_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Entretien et précautions",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>La coque est réutilisable longtemps. Seul le sédiment se remplace tous les 2 à 3 mois selon ton eau. Nettoyage extérieur doux à l'eau.</p><p>Filtration mécanique : ce n'est pas un dispositif de traitement de l'eau potable. L'eau filtrée est destinée au lavage des mains, du visage et au rinçage. Usage domestique uniquement.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "sticky_atc": {
          "type": "sticky-atc-bar",
          "settings": {
            "visibility": "all",
            "style": "minimalist",
            "container": "full",
            "show_atc_button": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout_buttons": false,
            "show_quantity": true
          }
        },
        "ss_complements": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-complements', items: \"filtre-a-robinet-faucet-sullab-sunsoari|Lot 3 Sédiments|3 sédiments, 6 à 9 mois de filtration\", title: \"Pour plus tard\", note: \"Le sédiment se change tous les 2 à 3 mois. Prends de l'avance sur tes recharges :\" %}"
          }
        },
        "ss_rating": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-rating', product: product %}"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ss_badge",
        "title",
        "ss_rating",
        "price",
        "description",
        "variant_picker",
        "buy_buttons",
        "ss_complements",
        "ss_facts",
        "reassurance",
        "acc_1",
        "acc_2",
        "sticky_atc"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        "@media (min-width: 1280px) {.product {padding-inline: 5rem; }}"
